# Frontend (`frontend/`)

## Stack

- Vite, React 18, TypeScript where used, Tailwind for styling.

## Scripts

- Local dev: `npm run dev` from `frontend/`.
- Production build: from `frontend/`, run `npm ci` (first time) then `npm run build` (or `npm run build` after dependencies are installed).

## Changes

- Follow existing component and file organization; keep UI changes consistent with current Tailwind usage.
- There is no `npm test` script in this package yet; rely on `npm run build` for a compile check after non-trivial edits.

## Local development

- See [docs/local-dev.md](docs/local-dev.md) for how the Vite app fits the Compose stack and env vars.
